1	/**
2	 * E2E tests for US-02 — Paso 2: Lista de planes por país con selección persistente.
3	 *
4	 * All Strapi HTTP calls are mocked with page.route().
5	 * No real Strapi instance is required.
6	 *
7	 * axe-core is injected per audit; violations at 'serious'/'critical' fail the test.
8	 * AC-02.16 keyboard-only test navigates without any mouse interaction.
9	 *
10	 * AC-02.1  — only active, published plans for the active country are shown
11	 * AC-02.2  — price formatted with currency symbol/code
12	 * AC-02.3  — vehicle older than 5 years triggers 10% surcharge + label
13	 * AC-02.4  — recommended=true plan shows "Recomendado" badge
14	 * AC-02.5  — clicking a plan marks it; "Continuar" is enabled
15	 * AC-02.6  — without selection "Continuar" is disabled
16	 * AC-02.7  — active=false plan does NOT appear in the list
17	 * AC-02.8  — "Volver" navigates to paso-1 and form data is preserved
18	 * AC-02.9  — loading indicator visible while request is pending
19	 * AC-02.10 — network error shows error message + retry button
20	 * AC-02.11 — data:[] response shows empty state
21	 * AC-02.12 — plan without coverages is discarded by zod (AC-02.13 overlap)
22	 * AC-02.13 — plan with wrong currency is discarded by zod
23	 * AC-02.14 — axe finds no serious/critical violations in ready state
24	 * AC-02.15 — responsive: visible at 375px and 1280px viewport widths
25	 * AC-02.16 — keyboard-only: Tab/arrows between plans, Space selects, Enter continues
26	 */
